<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DON SELLS FOOD INTERESTS, TO TAP MARKET.</title>
<headline>DON SELLS FOOD INTERESTS, TO TAP MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African hotel firm Don Group Ltd said on Monday that it had agreed to sell its food interests to various buyers for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The firm also announced that it would launch a right issue of shares to raise 65 million rand in order to cut its debt.</p>
</text>
